   "message": "SEB-268: site words in code (source line, findings rows, popups) (#710)\n\n* Site words in code: plain source line, route names, popups, broker lists\n\nCountry source line names the source in plain words after the rule. Finding rows: Argentina and\nBrazil by name, \"1 app\", the fee-level rows as sentences, 24 CriptoYa brokers said as one count,\ngaps shown with %. The routes chart popup says more expensive or cheaper in words. Every new word\nis a copy.json key from the writer PR, with the old text kept until it lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n* Country script version past the price list PR's\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
