   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-268: site words, one word per idea on every page (#709)\n\n* Site words: one word per idea everywhere, and the page fixes agreed in chat\n\ngap (never premium, difference, spread or points), cheaper and more expensive (never dearer),\nthe cheapest app (never best app), the stablecoin way (never path or route), people selling to\neach other (never person to person or between people), exchanges and brokers (never order books,\nvenues or broker quotes), \"from exchange history, not our own checks\" (never \"reported, not seen\nby us\"), and a missed hour shows as a blank. Plus the page by page rewrites Seb agreed on 27 Oct.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n* Keep the old source line until the page code reads the new one\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n* Routes chart popup in words\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
